        },
        {
          "exact_quote": "There were 38,840 ED visits and 496 regional patients who unintentionally fell from a window across the study period between 0 and 17 years old.",
          "url": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.acap.2020.07.008",
          "method": "Europe PMC 원시 캐시 초록 직접 열람; 신규 HTTP 아님",
